L591: ### A.6 Core Alignment Algorithm
L592: 
L593: Algorithm 1 SAM 3D Basic Alignment (Texture, Shape)
L594: 
L595: 1: Base model $\pi_{0}$, quality threshold curriculum $\alpha_{k}$, ensemble size $N$
L596: 
L597: 2: Aligned model $\pi_{K}$
L598: 
L599: 3: // Let $d=(I,M,S,T,R,t,s)$ denote a demonstration (i.e., a training sample)
L600: 
L601: 4: for $k=1$ to $K$ do
L602: 
L603: 5:   // Collection Step: Generate demonstrations via expert policy
L604: 
L606: 7:   for $(I,M)\sim p(\mathbf{I},\mathbf{M})$ do
L607: 
L608: 8:    $\tilde{\pi}_{k}\leftarrow\text{Amplify}(\pi_{k-1})$ $\triangleright$ Amplify current policy via model ensemble and best-of-$N$ search
L609: 
L610: 9:    Sample $\{d_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}\sim\tilde{\pi}_{k}(I,M)$ $\triangleright$ Generate $N$ candidate demonstrations from expert policy
L611: 
L612: 10:    $d^{*},r\leftarrow\text{HumanRank}(\{d_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N})$ $\triangleright$ Humans select best candidate via pairwise comparisons
L613: 11:    $\mathcal{R}\leftarrow\{d_{i}:i\neq\arg\max\}$ $\triangleright$ Store rejected candidates for preference learning
L614: 
L615: 12:    $\mathcal{C}_{k}\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{k}\cup\{(d^{*},r,\mathcal{R})\}$ $\triangleright$ Collect chosen demonstration with rating and rejections
L616: 
L617: 13:   end for
L618: 
L619: 14:   // Update Step: Train on aggregated high-quality demonstrations and preferences
L620: 15:   $\mathcal{C}\leftarrow\{(d^{+},\mathcal{R}):(d^{+},r,\mathcal{R})\in\bigcup_{i=1}^{k}\mathcal{C}_{i},r\geq\alpha_{k}\}$ $\triangleright$ Aggregate and filter by quality
L621: 
L622: 16:   $\mathcal{D}\leftarrow\{(d^{+},d^{-}):(d^{+},\mathcal{R})\in\mathcal{C},d^{-}\in\mathcal{R}\}$ $\triangleright$ Create preference pairs for DPO training
L623: 
L624: 17:   $\pi_{k}^{\text{SFT}}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\pi}\mathbb{E}_{(d^{+},d^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}[\mathcal{L}_{\text{CFM}}(\pi;d^{+})]$ $\triangleright$ Supervised finetuning
