L345: ##### Multi-stage training improves performance.
L346: 
L347: SAM 3D’s real-world performance emerges through multi-stage training. cite181†Table 4 reveals near-monotonic 3D shape improvements as each training stage is added, validating the approach that leads to the final model (last row). In the appendix, cite182†Figure 19 shows similar results for texture and cite183†Table 7 shows the contribution of each individual real-world data stage, by knocking out the MITL-3DO, Art-3DO data, or DPO stages.
